---@field column? string The name of the column.
---@field tableDataProfile? string The resource name of the table data profile.
---@field profileStatus? gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2ProfileStatus Success or error status from the most recent profile generation attempt. May be empty if the profile is still being generated.
---@field datasetId? string The BigQuery dataset ID, if the resource profiled is a BigQuery table.
---@field columnInfoType? gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2InfoTypeSummary If it's been determined this column can be identified as a single type, this will be set. Otherwise the column either has unidentifiable content or mixed types.
---@field estimatedUniquenessScore? gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2ColumnDataProfileEstimatedUniquenessScoreEnum Approximate uniqueness of the column.
