---Configuration for discovery to scan resources for profile generation. Only one discovery configuration may exist per organization, folder, or project. The generated data profiles are retained according to the [data retention policy] (https://docs.cloud.google.com/sensitive-data-protection/docs/data-profiles#retention).
---@class gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2DiscoveryConfig
---@field targets? gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2DiscoveryTargetList Target to match against for determining what to scan and how frequently.
---@field otherCloudStartingLocation? gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2OtherCloudDiscoveryStartingLocation Must be set only when scanning other clouds.
---@field inspectTemplates? gcp.dlp_v2.StringList Detection logic for profile generation. Not all template features are used by Discovery. FindingLimits, include_quote and exclude_info_types have no impact on Discovery. Multiple templates may be provided if there is data in multiple regions. At most one template must be specified per-region (including "global"). Each region is scanned using the applicable template. If no region-specific template is specified, but a "global" template is specified, it will be copied to that region and used instead. If no global or region-specific template is provided for a region with data, that region's data will not be scanned. For more information, see https://docs.cloud.google.com/sensitive-data-protection/docs/data-profiles#data-residency.
---@field createTime? string Output only. The creation timestamp of a DiscoveryConfig.
---@field actions? gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2DataProfileActionList Actions to execute at the completion of scanning.
---@field processingLocation? gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2ProcessingLocation Optional. Processing location configuration. Vertex AI dataset scanning will set processing_location.image_fallback_type to MultiRegionProcessing by default.
---@field orgConfig? gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2OrgConfig Only set when the parent is an org.
---@field errors? gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2ErrorList Output only. A stream of errors encountered when the config was activated. Repeated errors may result in the config automatically being paused. Output only field. Will return the last 100 errors. Whenever the config is modified this list will be cleared.
---@field status? gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2DiscoveryConfigStatusEnum|string Required. A status for this configuration.
---@field displayName? string Display name (max 100 chars)
---@field lastRunTime? string Output only. The timestamp of the last time this config was executed.
---@field name? string Output only. Unique resource name for the DiscoveryConfig, assigned by the service when the DiscoveryConfig is created, for example `projects/dlp-test-project/locations/global/discoveryConfigs/53234423`.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. The last update timestamp of a DiscoveryConfig.

---@alias gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2DiscoveryConfigList gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2DiscoveryConfig[]

---@alias gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2DiscoveryConfigStatusEnum "STATUS_UNSPECIFIED"|"RUNNING"|"PAUSED"

