---@field errors? gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2ErrorList Output only. A stream of errors encountered when the trigger was activated. Repeated errors may result in the JobTrigger automatically being paused. Will return the last 100 errors. Whenever the JobTrigger is modified this list will be cleared.
---@field lastRunTime? string Output only. The timestamp of the last time this trigger executed.
---@field inspectJob? gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2InspectJobConfig For inspect jobs, a snapshot of the configuration.
