---@field quasiIds? gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2FieldIdList Set of quasi-identifiers indicating how equivalence classes are defined for the l-diversity computation. When multiple fields are specified, they are considered a single composite key.

---The set of columns' values that share the same ldiversity value.
