---@field numDistinctSensitiveValues? string Number of distinct sensitive values in this equivalence class.

---@alias gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2LDiversityEquivalenceClassList gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2LDiversityEquivalenceClass[]

---Histogram of l-diversity equivalence class sensitive value frequencies.
---@class gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2LDiversityHistogramBucket
---@field sensitiveValueFrequencyLowerBound? string Lower bound on the sensitive value frequencies of the equivalence classes in this bucket.
---@field bucketSize? string Total number of equivalence classes in this bucket.
---@field sensitiveValueFrequencyUpperBound? string Upper bound on the sensitive value frequencies of the equivalence classes in this bucket.
---@field bucketValueCount? string Total number of distinct equivalence classes in this bucket.
---@field bucketValues? gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2LDiversityEquivalenceClassList Sample of equivalence classes in this bucket. The total number of classes returned per bucket is capped at 20.

---@alias gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2LDiversityHistogramBucketList gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2LDiversityHistogramBucket[]

---Result of the l-diversity computation.
---@class gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2LDiversityResult
---@field sensitiveValueFrequencyHistogramBuckets? gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2LDiversityHistogramBucketList Histogram of l-diversity equivalence class sensitive value frequencies.

