---@field includeRegexes? gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2OtherCloudResourceRegexes A collection of regular expressions to match a resource against.

---A pattern to match against one or more resources. At least one pattern must be specified. Regular expressions use RE2 [syntax](https://github.com/google/re2/wiki/Syntax); a guide can be found under the google/re2 repository on GitHub.
---@class gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2OtherCloudResourceRegex
---@field amazonS3BucketRegex? gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2AmazonS3BucketRegex Regex for Amazon S3 buckets.

---@alias gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2OtherCloudResourceRegexList gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2OtherCloudResourceRegex[]

