---If set, a summary finding will be created or updated in Security Command Center for each profile.
---@class gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2PublishToSecurityCommandCenter

---Enable Stackdriver metric dlp.googleapis.com/finding_count. This will publish a metric to stack driver on each infotype requested and how many findings were found for it. CustomDetectors will be bucketed as 'Custom' under the Stackdriver label 'info_type'.
---@class gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2PublishToStackdriver

