---@field field? gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2FieldId Set if the transformation was limited to a specific FieldId.
---@field fieldTransformations? gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2FieldTransformationList The field transformation that was applied. If multiple field transformations are requested for a single field, this list will contain all of them; otherwise, only one is supplied.
---@field recordSuppress? gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2RecordSuppression The specific suppression option these stats apply to.
---@field transformation? gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2PrimitiveTransformation The specific transformation these stats apply to.
---@field infoType? gcp.dlp_v2.GooglePrivacyDlpV2InfoType Set if the transformation was limited to a specific InfoType.
---@field transformedBytes? string Total size in bytes that were transformed in some way.

